<title>GERMANY: German intervention rye sought for export.</title>
<headline>German intervention rye sought for export.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>German grain traders placed bids for the export of 5,200 tonnes of intervention rye to third countries, the state grain intervention board BLE said on Thursday.</p>
<p>No bid were placed for intervention barley.</p>
<p>The bids will be discussed at the EU weekly grain meeting later on Thursday.</p>
</text>
